---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base
  title="About Leonida Racing — GTA VI Racing Database & Community"
  description="See how Leonida Racing brings GTA 6 car data, lap times, racing crews, events, hosts, and creators together in one community."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">GTA VI Racing Database &amp; Community</p>
      <h1 class="display page-title">About Leonida Racing</h1>
      <p class="page-lede">Leonida Racing is a GTA VI racing database and community. Check car specs and lap times, find races and crews, and connect with drivers, hosts, and creators across the scene.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <div class="wrap prose-body">
      <h2>The Database</h2>
      <p>The Garage is Leonida Racing’s GTA VI vehicle database. It brings specs, key vehicle details, real-life inspirations, and your own collection together in one place. Use it to compare cars, choose your next one, and keep track of what you own.</p>
      <p>Time Attack adds the driver to the equation: submit a lap at Gellhorn International Raceway, follow the leaderboard, and see what each car can do in the hands of the community.</p>

      <h2>The Community</h2>
      <p>The Hub is where the GTA VI racing scene comes together. Find races, league rounds, community playlists, car meets, and crews.</p>
      <p>Connect with drivers, hosts, and creators, see what the scene is organizing, or bring something of your own.</p>

      <h2>Built for Racers and Car People</h2>
      <p>You do not have to chase an overall record to be part of Leonida Racing. You might be looking for the right car, a better time, a competitive crew, a relaxed car meet, or simply a full grid.</p>
      <p>If GTA VI cars and racing matter to you, this is your scene.</p>

      <h2>Independent</h2>
      <p>Leonida Racing is an independent community project built for GTA VI racers and car enthusiasts. It is not affiliated with Rockstar Games or Take-Two Interactive.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Found incorrect vehicle data, have a question about a lap submission, or need help with a listing? Reach us on <a href="https://discord.gg/hPGuBwXRqT" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a> or use the email address in the <a href={`${base}legal/`}>legal notice</a>.</p>

      <h2>How Your Data Is Used</h2>
      <p>Signing in uses Discord. We store the account details needed for your profile and the lap information and evidence needed to review and display your submissions.</p>
      <p>The <a href={`${base}privacy/`}>Privacy Policy</a> explains what is collected, why, and for how long.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="wrap cta-row">
      <div>
        <h2 class="display cta-title">Join the Community</h2>
        <p class="cta-copy">Talk cars, meet racers, find events, and bring something of your own to Leonida Racing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href={`${base}cars/`}>Explore The Garage</a>
        <a class="btn btn-red" href="https://discord.gg/hPGuBwXRqT" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .page-title { margin: .6rem 0 .9rem; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem); }
  .page-lede { max-width: 60ch; color: var(--gh-muted); font-size: 1.02rem; }

  .prose { padding-bottom: var(--gh-gap-section); }
  .prose-body { max-width: 62ch; }
  .prose-body h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 2.2rem 0 .7rem; }
  .prose-body h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .prose-body p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--gh-muted); font-size: .96rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .prose-body ul { margin: 0 0 1rem; padding-left: 1.1rem; display: grid; gap: .6rem; color: var(--gh-muted); font-size: .96rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .prose-body li strong { color: var(--gh-text); }
  .prose-body a { color: var(--gh-text); }

  .cta-band { padding-block: var(--gh-gap-section); border-top: 1px solid var(--gh-line); background: var(--gh-surface-soft); }
  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; }
  .cta-title { margin: 0 0 .5rem; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2rem); }
  .cta-copy { margin: 0; max-width: 42ch; color: var(--gh-muted); font-size: .95rem; }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; gap: .75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>
